{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41647","headline":"小笛弄 · 陈陶","name":"小笛弄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一尺玲珑握中翠，僊娥月浦呼龙子。\n五夜流珠粲梦卿，九青鸾倚洪崖醉。\n丹穴饥儿笑风雨，娲皇碧玉星星语。\n蛇蝎愁闻骨髓寒，江山恨老眠秋雾。\n绮席鸳鸯冷朱翠，星流露泫谁驱使。\n江南一曲罢伶伦，芙蓉水殿春风起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}